# Hindering Light: Bot2's Lightning Bolt at Bot1 targets a player Bot1 is, so Bot1 counters it and draws a card.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Hindering Light
Plains x4
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x5
Mountain x10

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1)
? Stack = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Hindering Light.Cast(Bot2)
Bot1.Hand.Hindering Light.Cast(Lightning Bolt)
? Stack = Hindering Light; Lightning Bolt

[Expect]
Turn = 2
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Graveyard = Hindering Light
Bot2.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt
Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
